// User interface messages: IC_MSG(Key, English, Russian, Chinese, French, Spanish)
//
// Included by i18n.h (to declare Msg::Key) and i18n.cpp (to build the
// table). Placeholders {0}, {1}, ... are filled by tr(msg, {args}).
// Keep keys grouped by where they appear.

